---
title: Writeback reconciliation
---
flowchart TD
  queue[Append-only lifecycle rows] --> window[Keep rows through window end]
  window --> latest[Newest timestamp per ID]
  latest --> tie{Timestamps tie?}
  tie -->|Yes| append[Last appended row]
  tie -->|No| selected[Selected row]
  append --> selected
  selected --> kind[Normalize kind aliases]
  kind --> report[One state per ID]
